## Build context exclusions.
##
## As with the issuer: keep the image small, and keep key material out of it.
## certs/ holds committed test keys (cert.pem, key.pem, client.key), TLS
## material is mounted at runtime instead, so none of it belongs in a layer.

.git
.gitignore
.github

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.venv
venv

# Key material, mounted at runtime, never baked in.
certs/
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12

# Host-specific / local noise
run.sh
*.md
.env
.DS_Store
